 and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR.\n\n* 9 Unique Levels \n* Different Guns & Wackers Each Gallery\n* Unlock Badges For Your \"Wall Of Achievement\" With Each Victory\n*Earned Trophies Come To Life In Your Home Gallery\n\nWack-Ammo is a must play for every Quest owner.", "short_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames/wackammo", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "John Ray Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SHOOTER", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "92494406751665